1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:06,840
Every discipline has one concept that students struggle to see.

2
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:10,340
In your course, which one is it?

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:20,029
At İDÜ Lab, it can become a game your students play in the lecture hall.

4
00:00:28,775 --> 00:00:34,415
The university section already holds more than ninety games across nine faculties.

5
00:00:34,475 --> 00:00:41,015
Each one models a difficult concept, so students learn by testing rather than by memorising.

6
00:00:41,075 --> 00:00:46,415
Run them in a lecture-hall competition, or in projector and board mode.

7
00:00:46,475 --> 00:00:58,673
Is your topic missing? Lecturers from any university can request a game: the team designs it around the predict–test–explain loop, tests it with you and publishes it.

8
00:00:59,283 --> 00:01:01,123
Your contribution is visible.

9
00:01:01,183 --> 00:01:07,523
Game proposers are named on the academic contribution page, alongside authors and supporters.

10
00:01:07,583 --> 00:01:14,323
Pick the version you used and export the citation: APA, BibTeX, RIS, CSL JSON or CFF.

11
00:01:14,383 --> 00:01:21,123
And the contributors page follows each idea from proposal to published game.

12
00:01:21,183 --> 00:01:29,182
Name the contribution. Cite the work.

13
00:01:29,792 --> 00:01:32,232
It is also a research platform.

14
00:01:32,292 --> 00:01:41,232
Kuark, the platform’s guide, improves through open causal research.

15
00:01:41,292 --> 00:01:47,632
Participation is voluntary, conditions are randomly assigned, and outcomes are verified by the server.

16
00:01:47,692 --> 00:01:53,232
An improvement goes live only after the evidence supports it.

17
00:01:53,292 --> 00:01:59,690
And a manuscript draft is never presented as a published finding.

18
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:02,140
Bring your department in.

19
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:10,540
Fork a game for your own course: choose the levels, name it, and publish it with your logo next to ours.

20
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:19,340
The engine and verification stay the same, and every fork goes into a signed lineage ledger anyone can check.

21
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:30,198
And for students, the games stay free, in twenty-five languages.

22
00:02:30,708 --> 00:02:32,048
Being a faculty member at İDÜ Lab means this:

23
00:02:32,108 --> 00:02:34,048
Your hardest concept

24
00:02:34,108 --> 00:02:38,048
becomes your students’ favourite level.

25
00:02:38,108 --> 00:02:46,470
Let’s build it together.

